-# Database Persistence Architecture: Dalil Operations & Agency Hub
-
-Integrate reliable, free-tier cloud database persistence to store and synchronize Dalil's core operational entities: verified agency profiles, tour packages and sample itineraries, operational trip files, and traveler passcodes. This provides live synchronization across devices and team members with zero infrastructure overhead.
-
-## User Review & Critical Decisions
-
-> [!IMPORTANT]
-> The following architectural and data choices were confirmed through your selections:
-> - **Hosting & Database Engine**: Managed free-tier cloud persistence with real-time sync and zero scale costs.
-> - **Prioritized Data Models**:
->   1. **Agency Profiles & Branding**: Ministry of Tourism Class A credentials, fleet specs, contact hotlines, cover/logo media, and verified partner reviews.
->   2. **Tour Packages & Itineraries**: Multi-day signature programs (Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, Red Sea) with pricing rules, inclusions, and route waypoints.
->   3. **Operational Trip Files**: Active files with pax counts, assigned guides/drivers, flight times, and voucher statuses.
-> - **Authentication & Authorization**: Built-in free-tier authentication with role-based access for agency managers, operations dispatchers, and travelers.
-
----
-
-## 1. Overview & Core Concept
-
-- **What It Delivers**: Replaces client-only local storage with persistent, multi-device cloud storage. Any edits made in the Agency Profile Editor, new trip files created by operations dispatchers, and inquiries submitted by international B2B partners are safely persisted and accessible in real-time.
-- **Target Users**:
-  - **DMC Operations Team & Dispatchers**: Real-time management of active trip files, guide assignments, and schedule adjustments.
-  - **Agency Administrators**: Editing company credentials, fleet specs, and signature package pricing.
-  - **Travelers & Tour Leaders**: Accessing digital trip vouchers and daily schedules via passcodes.
-- **Key Value**: Guarantees zero data loss across browser reloads or device switches, enables multiple staff members to work on the same trip file simultaneously, and keeps B2B showcase listings updated live.
-
----
-
-## 2. User Experience & Data Workflows
-
-```
