-### Automated Verification
-- Verify database schemas and security rules with zero linting errors (`lint_applet`).
-- Full build and bundle compilation verification (`compile_applet`).
-
-### Manual Functional Verification
-1. Create or edit an agency profile and verify changes persist after refreshing the application.
-2. Add a new tour package in the showcase and confirm it appears in real-time.
-3. Create an operational trip file and verify retrieval in the operations dashboard.
