-## 6. Traveler & Public Discovery Hub Architecture (Completed)
-
-- **Frictionless Public Entry**: Any traveler or visitor enters the app freely without needing a booking code or choosing an agency upfront.
-- **Dedicated Traveler Hub (`TravelerHubView.tsx`)**:
-  - 100% display and inquiry oriented with zero B2B subscription menus or net pricing exposure.
-  - Full directory of accredited Egyptian tour operators (Class A) with license numbers, governorates, spoken languages, and star ratings.
-  - Direct 1-click WhatsApp and phone communication channels.
-  - In-app custom itinerary quote request modal (`PublicTripRequestForm`).
-- **Internal Booking Code & Agency Selector Section**:
-  - The previous external code gate has been moved inside the Traveler Hub.
-  - Travelers with an existing reservation or quote (e.g. `EG-7842`, `GARCIA-01`, `DAL-2026-9481`) can enter it at will to open interactive live itineraries, driver/guide contacts, and hotel vouchers.
-  - Direct agency selector dropdown to jump to any agency profile.
-- **Role & Desk Switching**: Seamless toggle between Traveler Hub (`🌍 بوابة المسافرين`) and DMC Operator Desk (`🏢 مكتب شركات السياحة B2B`) in the top navigation bars.
