-## 2. Technology Stack & Runtime Topology
-
-- **Server Runtime**: Node.js with Express and TypeScript (`tsx`).
-- **Development Tooling**: Vite with custom Express middleware integration.
-- **Frontend Framework**: React 18 (functional components, custom hooks, strictly typed).
-- **Styling Architecture**: Tailwind CSS with custom Mediterranean Deep Navy (`#0f2035`) and Ivory Canvas (`#faf7f2`) design system.
-- **Animation & Physics**: `motion/react` (Framer Motion) with strict accessible `useReducedMotion` fallbacks.
-- **AI Model**: Google Gemini API via `@google/genai` TypeScript SDK (model: `gemini-3.8-flash`) executed exclusively on the backend proxy (`/api/ai/*`).
-- **Icons**: Lucide React.
-- **Database & Sync**:
-  - Primary Local Engine: High-performance localStorage cache with structured keys (`qde_*`).
-  - Cloud Synchronization: Google Cloud Firestore (`ai-studio-quotedeskegypt-*`) via `dbSync.ts`.
-  - Identity & Auth: Firebase Authentication with Google OAuth popup and email/password fallback.
