-## 5. Data Models & Type Definitions (`src/types/index.ts`)
-
-`src/types/index.ts` houses the TypeScript types and interfaces that enforce data integrity throughout the application:
-
-- **`Workspace`**: Represents the tour operator company. Fields include `id`, `name`, `subdomain`, `licenseNumber` (Ministry of Tourism Category A), `taxRegistrationNumber`, `address`, `governorates`, `contactPhone`, `brandColors` (`primary`, `accent`, `gold`), `defaultCurrency`, `minimumMarginPercent`, and `hideNetCostsFromAgents`.
-- **`User` & `UserRole`**: `UserRole` is `'Owner' | 'Admin' | 'Sales Agent' | 'Operations' | 'Viewer'`. Contains `canViewNetCostsOverride` to control visibility of supplier buy prices.
-- **`Supplier`**: Travel service provider record with `category` (`Hotel`, `Nile Cruise`, `Transport`, `Guide`, `Monuments Authority`, `Flight`, `Other`), `contactName`, `phone`, `email`, and `city`.
-- **`Rate`**: The atomic building block of pricing. Contains:
-  - `supplierId`, `serviceName`, `category`, `city`.
-  - `seasonId`: Links to named date ranges.
-  - `rateBasis`: `'per_person' | 'per_room' | 'per_vehicle' | 'per_group' | 'fixed'`.
-  - `occupancy`: `'Single' | 'Double' | 'Triple' | 'Family' | 'Vehicle'`.
-  - `netCost`: Direct contracting buy cost in `costCurrency` (`EGP`, `USD`, `EUR`, `GBP`).
-  - `childRatePolicy`: Percentage discounts by child age brackets.
-  - `nationalityTier`: `'Foreign' | 'Arab' | 'Egyptian' | 'Student'` (essential for accurate Egyptian monuments ticketing).
-- **`Inquiry`**: Captured client lead with `rawText`, `sourceChannel` (`WhatsApp`, `Email`, `WebForm`, `Phone`), `status` (`New`, `In Review`, `Quoted`, `Follow-up`, `Closed`), and `parsedRequirements`.
-- **`Quote` & `QuoteLine`**:
-  - `Quote`: The priced proposal object. Contains `days: QuoteDay[]`, `totalCostEgp`, `totalPriceEgp`, `totalPriceQuoteCurrency`, `marginPercent`, `targetCurrency`, `b2bCommissionPercent`, and `publicToken`.
-  - `QuoteLine`: Individual service on a given day. Contains `rateId`, `netCostEgp`, `sellPriceEgp`, `quantity`, `paxCount`, and `isContractRateMissing`.
-- **`TripFile`**: The post-booking operational execution file (see Section 6 for full details).
-- **`SupplierVoucher`**: Branded service voucher with legal tax registration, voucher code, confirmation number, and billing terms.
