-## 6. Core Libraries & Business Logic (`src/lib/`)
-
-### Deterministic Pricing Engine (`pricingEngine.ts`)
-The mathematical core of Dalil. It ensures that prices are calculated accurately and transparently:
-- **`calculateQuotePricing(quote, rates, exchangeRates, workspace)`**: Loops over every `QuoteDay` and `QuoteLine`, matches the relevant `Rate` record, checks seasonal date boundaries, and calculates:
-  1. Base Net Cost in contracted currency.
-  2. Exchange rate conversion into EGP using `getEffectiveExchangeRate()` with the DMC's safety buffer.
-  3. Total net cost in EGP.
-  4. Sell price based on `targetMarginPercent`: $\text{Sell Price} = \frac{\text{Net Cost}}{1 - \text{Margin}}$.
-  5. Conversion to client's target currency (USD, EUR, GBP).
-- **`matchContractedRate(line, rates, season)`**: Finds the exact contracted rate matching supplier, city, occupancy type, and nationality tier.
-- **`validateMarginGuardrail(margin, workspace)`**: Throws an error or triggers an approval requirement if a quote's margin falls below `workspace.minimumMarginPercent`.
-
-### Storage & Repository Layer (`storage.ts`)
-A strongly-typed data persistence layer operating with localized storage and memory fallback:
-- **`repository` Object**:
-  - `getWorkspace()`, `saveWorkspace(ws)`: Manages company identity and configuration.
-  - `getQuotes(wsId)`, `saveQuote(quote)`, `deleteQuote(id)`: CRUD operations for quotes.
-  - `getInquiries(wsId)`, `saveInquiry(inquiry)`: Inquiry management.
-  - `getRates(wsId)`, `saveRate(rate)`, `deleteRate(id)`: Rate library management.
-  - `getSuppliers(wsId)`, `saveSupplier(s)`: Supplier partner records.
-  - `getFollowUps(wsId)`, `saveFollowUp(task)`: Client follow-up reminders.
-  - `getAuditLogs(wsId)`, `logAction(...)`: Implements an immutable audit trail recording every rate change, proposal view, and user permission modification.
-
-### Trip & Operations Store (`tripStore.ts`)
-Manages confirmed trip files once a client accepts a quote:
-- **`TripFile` Interface**:
-  - `id`, `fileNumber` (e.g. `EG-2026-VIP`), `tourPasscode` (e.g. `EG-7842`).
-  - `travelerName`, `startDate`, `durationDays`, `status` (`Planning`, `Confirmed`, `Operating`, `Completed`, `Cancelled`).
-  - `arrival`: `{ flight, date, time, airport, meetAndAssist }`.
-  - `departure`: `{ flight, date, time, airport }`.
-  - `guideName`, `guidePhone`, `guideLanguage`, `guideLicense`.
-  - `driverName`, `driverPhone`, `vehiclePlate`, `vehicleType`.
-  - `passengers`: Array of `TripPassenger` (`name`, `nationality`, `type`, `room`, `dietary`, `personalCode`, `phone`).
-  - `services`: Array of `TripService` (`dayNumber`, `serviceName`, `supplierName`, `supplierType`, `city`, `status`, `confirmationNo`, `note`).
-  - `checklist`: 16-step operational readiness items.
-  - `log`: Timestamped incident and operational notes.
-- **`loadTrips()`**: Loads active trips from storage. If empty, automatically seeds realistic default Egyptian tour delegations (*Garcia VIP Delegation*, *Schmidt Archaeology Tour*) with confirmed services, room assignments, and transportation details.
-- **`saveTrips(trips)`**: Persists trips locally and invokes background cloud sync.
-- **`findTripOrGuestByCode(code)`**: Looks up any trip file or individual passenger by tour code or personal passcode (e.g. `EG-7842` or `GARCIA-01`).
-- **`createTripFromQuote(quote, count)`**: Instantiates a complete operational `TripFile` from an accepted `Quote`, mapping all itinerary days and lines to `TripService` items.
-
-### Voucher Service (`voucherService.ts`)
-Automates operations vouchers and dispatch communication:
-- **`generateVouchersFromQuote(quote, tripFile, workspace)`**: Generates structured `SupplierVoucher` items for each hotel, cruise line, limousine transfer, and monument excursion.
-- **`formatWhatsAppDispatchMessage(voucher, workspace)`**: Creates pre-formatted bilingual WhatsApp dispatch text for local suppliers.
-- **`generatePrintableVoucherHtml(voucher, workspace)`**: Renders a print-ready A4 voucher complete with DMC header, Ministry of Tourism license number, tax registration, barcode, confirmation code, and signature stamp box.
-- **`generateBatchVouchersHtml(vouchers, workspace)`**: Compiles all vouchers for a trip into a single paginated operations binder document.
-
-### Geographic & Routing Engine (`distanceMatrix.ts` & `geoCoordinates.ts`)
-- **`EGYPT_GEO_COORDINATES`**: Accurate latitude/longitude database for Egyptian tourist destinations (Giza Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, Saqqara, Valley of the Kings, Karnak Temple, Luxor Temple, Philae Temple, Abu Simbel, Hurghada Marina, Cairo Airport terminals).
-- **`calculateItineraryDistanceMatrix(locations)`**: Communicates with the backend `/api/google-maps/distance-matrix` route to provide real driving distances and transit times between tour stops.
