-## 10. End-to-End Operational Lifecycle
-
-The complete workflow in Dalil follows seven integrated stages:
-
-```
-[1. Inbound Inquiry]
-        │
-        ▼ (WhatsApp / Email / Web)
-[2. AI Parsing & Verification] ──► Human Agent Reviews Side-by-Side in Modal
-        │
-        ▼
-[3. Deterministic Pricing Engine] ──► Resolves contracted rates, applies seasonal rules, calculates margin
-        │
-        ▼
-[4. Proposal Presentation] ──► Branded, interactive, translated into 7 languages
-        │
-        ▼ (Client accepts proposal)
-[5. Trip Operations Radar] ──► Converts Quote into Operational Trip File
-        │
-        ├───────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┐
-        ▼                               ▼                               ▼
-[Fleet & Transport Desk]     [Tour Guides & Reps Desk]    [Hotel Rooming & Cabins Desk]
-  - Vehicle Roster              - Egyptologist Match        - Room Allocations (SGL/DBL/SUT)
-  - Ministry Waybills           - Syndicate Letters         - Rooming List CSV Export
-  - WhatsApp Driver Orders      - Airport Rep Passes        - Dietary & Passport Records
-        │                               │                               │
-        └───────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘
-                                        │
-                                        ▼
-                          [Vouchers & Dispatch Console]
-                            - Branded A4 Service Vouchers
-                            - 1-Click Batch Print Operations Pack
-                            - WhatsApp Supplier Confirmations
-                                        │
-                                        ▼
-                          [Traveler Mobile Portal]
-                            - Passenger enters passcode (EG-7842)
-                            - Live itinerary, chauffeur call, barcodes
-```
-
-1. **Inbound Inquiry**: Captured in `InboxView.tsx` from WhatsApp, email, or web channels.
-2. **AI Extraction**: `WhatsAppParserModal.tsx` calls backend Gemini API to extract dates, group size, and destination cities without saving unverified data.
-3. **Deterministic Pricing**: `QuoteBuilderView.tsx` pairs requirements with `RateLibraryView.tsx` using `pricingEngine.ts`. Line items calculate net costs in EGP, currency conversion with safety buffers, and margin guardrail enforcement.
-4. **Proposal Dispatch**: `ProposalViewer.tsx` delivers a branded presentation link with 1-click multilingual translation, itinerary timelines, and static bank wire instructions.
-5. **Operational Conversion**: Acceptance creates a `TripFile` in `TripOperationsView.tsx`.
-6. **Field Logistics Dispatch**:
-   - `FleetTransportationView.tsx` dispatches vehicles and prints Ministry of Tourism movement orders.
-   - `TourGuidesRepsView.tsx` assigns Egyptologist guides and prints Syndicate assignment letters.
-   - `HotelRoomingListsView.tsx` exports CSV manifests for hotel reservations.
-   - `VouchersDispatchView.tsx` batch-prints A4 operations packs.
-7. **Traveler Experience**: Tourists access `TravelerMobilePortal.tsx` via their passcodes to view their daily program, contact their chauffeur, and access accommodation vouchers.
